  "body": "We return \"failure\" from a [bunch](https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#forgiving-base64-decode) [of](https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-domain-to-ascii) [algorithms](https://mimesniff.spec.whatwg.org/#parse-a-mime-type), but I don't think we define what we mean. (It'd be a singleton type like undefined and null.) Should we add a definition in https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#primitive-data-types?\r\n\r\n@inexorabletash also points out that we're missing `<dfn>` markers for null, true, and false, and we're missing an Infra-level \"undefined\" entirely.",
